                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.00/24405: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul at Mexicali</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Boyle</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-07-30T20:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 30, 1920—8
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your telegram 29th. Military Intelligence Officer, Calexico, instructed to confer
                    with you concerning aviators. Render him every possible facility to prevent them
                    violating neutrality laws.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Colby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
